{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13728","headline":"华山西冈游赠隐玄叟 · 顾况","name":"华山西冈游赠隐玄叟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"羣峰郁初霁，泼黛若鬟沐。\n失风鼓唅呀，摇撼千灌木。\n木叶微堕黄，石泉净停绿。\n危磴萝薜牵，逈步入幽谷。\n我心寄青霞，世事惭苍鹿。\n遂令巢许辈，于焉谢尘俗。\n想是悠悠云，可契去留躅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13728.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13728","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}